WEBVTT

00:04:59.246 --> 00:05:02.371
Yah sahayogiyon aur maanav
sansaadhanon ke paas jahate hain

00:05:02.371 --> 00:05:04.746
kaaryasthal ko adhik samaaveshee

00:05:04.746 --> 00:05:05.871
banaane ke baare mein

00:05:05.871 --> 00:05:08.038
Yeh sirph unakee
madad nahin karega

00:05:08.038 --> 00:05:09.413
lekin shaayad koee aur bhee

00:05:09.413 --> 00:05:10.621
Mere maamale mein,

00:05:10.621 --> 00:05:13.413
Svayan aur any logon ne 
mere eemel hastaakshar

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:15.413
mein sarvanaam jode

00:05:15.413 --> 00:05:16.996
saamaany karne ke lie

00:05:16.996 --> 00:05:19.079
Aap HR se baat kar sakate hain

00:05:19.079 --> 00:05:21.996
Adhik samaaveshee svaasthy
neetiyon je baare men

00:05:21.996 --> 00:05:24.579
Meree aakhiree salaah shrota

00:05:24.579 --> 00:05:26.163
aur neta donon ke lie hai

00:05:26.163 --> 00:05:28.538
Yaad rakhen ki ve
vahee vyakti hain

00:05:28.538 --> 00:05:30.163
jinhen aap hamesha
se jaanate hain